permit (principal is User, action == Action::"signContract", resource is Contract)
when { ((((principal.signingAuthority == 0) || (principal.signingAuthority == 1) || (principal.signingAuthority == 2)) && (resource.contractValue >= 0) && ((resource.requiredAuthority == 0) || (resource.requiredAuthority == 1) || (resource.requiredAuthority == 2))) && ((principal.roles.contains(Role::"Signatory") || principal.roles.contains(Role::"ContractAdmin"))) && (!(((resource.contractValue > 10000000))) || (principal.signingAuthority >= resource.requiredAuthority) || (context.escalationApproved && (principal.roles.contains(Role::"Signatory")))) && (!(true) || (resource.status == ContractStatusValue::"approved")) && ((principal.roles.contains(Role::"Signatory")))) };
